### 1. Create a URL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.apple.com",
  "customAlias": "apple-test"
}

### 2. Simulate a Click
# @no-redirect
GET http://localhost:8080/apple-test

### 3. Check Analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/apple-test/stats